Package: omicidxr
Title: Query SRA, GEO, BioSample and BioProject Metadata from OmicIDX
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Sean",
           family = "Davis",
           email = "seandavi@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8991-6458")),
    person(given = "National Cancer Institute",
           role = "fnd",
           comment = "ITCR award U24CA289073"))
Description: OmicIDX publishes metadata from NCBI SRA, GEO, BioSample
    and BioProject as Parquet files, rebuilt nightly and released
    monthly. omicidxr connects DuckDB to a chosen release, so tens of
    millions of records can be queried with SQL or dplyr without
    downloading them. Helpers for accession conversion, run listing,
    GEO sample annotation and text search replace the main functions of
    the SRAdb and GEOmetadb packages, and releases can be pinned for
    reproducible analyses.
